    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48593" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">torrĭdo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum,
			1, v. a.
			torridus, <i>to scorch</i>, <i>parch</i>, <i>burn</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">torris dicitur fax, unde et torridare dicimus
					comburere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Non. 15, 27</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anhelis ardoribus torridatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 6, § 602</span></i>
			.</div>
